      "hint": {
        "zh": "<level-ref to=\"1-13\"></level-ref>和<level-ref to=\"1-14\"></level-ref>各解决了一件事，这次纸上还有字。字的笔画只有一格粗，纸边却是一大片亮挨着一大片暗。"
      },
      "views": { "in": "pixels", "out": "pixels", "mid": "terrain" },
      "check": { "tolerance": 0.02, "mismatches": 8 },
      "scene": "scan",
      "setup": { "expect": "paper" },
